    "text": "<p>Match the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mtext>p</mtext></msub><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mtext>v</mtext></msub></mfrac></math> ratio for ideal gases with different type of molecules:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Molecule Type</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mtext>p</mtext></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mtext>v</mtext></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A) Monoatomic</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B) Diatomic rigid molecules</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>7</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C) Diatomic non-rigid molecules</td>\t\t\t<td>(III)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D) Triatomic rigid molecules</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>"
